 "notes": "All three old kinds kept (old Metafine/3M, Grandmaster/Revox, Microcassette/Olympus, Mini-Cassette/Philips, Picocassette and Playaway models became archetypes); reel-to-reel, 8-track, DAT, DCC and Elcaset added. Tape types, lengths and Dolby are 't'. Left out: TDK SA and Maxell UD-XL II launch years and The Tape Project start year (only in search snippets), Sony 'Metal Master' (only the 1992 Super Metal Master was attested), Playaway View (a video player, not audiobook). DAT/DCC/Elcaset carry no archetypes; pre-recorded issues were rare."
